# --- Local card data: never commit or publish this ---
# Cards live only in the browser (IndexedDB/localStorage) or in files the user
# downloads to disk (CSV / JSON backup / PDF / ZIP). These patterns keep that
# data out of the git repository and off GitHub. `sample.csv` is the bundled
# demo template (programmatic dummy cards), so it stays tracked on purpose.
*.csv
!sample.csv
card-generator-backup-*.json
*-backup-*.json
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db3
*.mdb
/data/
/exports/
/backups/
card-images-*.zip
cards-*.pdf
*-card.pdf
